---
description: Frontend implementation rules
globs:
  - "app/**"
  - "components/**"
  - "src/ui/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
- No privileged keys in browser bundles.
- No domain rule duplication inside components.
- Prefer server-backed commands for mutations.
- Render explicit loading, empty, success and error states.
- Preserve keyboard/focus/accessibility.
- Use design tokens; do not invent one-off spacing/colors.
- Avoid chat-first layouts.
